    "chunk_text": "To Eallum Folke. Leofan menn, understanda\u00f0 georne, eallswa eow mycel \u00f0earf is, \u00fe\u00e6t ge eowres cristendomes gescead And butan ge hit on Leden geleornian magan, geleornia\u00f0 hit on Englisc \u00feus: Eala ure f\u00e6der \u00fee on & \u00f0in ricedom ofer us rixie symble, & \u00f0in willa gewyr\u00f0e swa swa on heofonum eac swa on eor\u00f0an. Geunn us to \u00feissum d\u00e6ge d\u00e6ghwamlices fostres. And us gemildsa swa swa we miltsia\u00f0 \u00feam \u00f0e wi\u00f0 us agylta\u00fe; & ne l\u00e6t \u00f0u us costnian ealles to swy\u00f0e, Gloria patri et filio et spiritui sancto. A sy lof & wuldor f\u00e6der & suna & halgum gaste, swa swa on fruman w\u00e6s & gyt is & symble bi\u00f0 in Leofan men, utan don swa us mycel \u00feearf is, habban anr\u00e6dne geleafan & fulne hiht on urne Drihten. And se \u00f0e \u00feurh Ledenspr\u00e6ce rihtne geleafan understandan ne cunne, geleornige huru on Englisc & We gelyfa\u00f0 on \u00e6nne God \u00e6lmihtigne \u00fee ealle \u00feingc gesceop & geworhte. And we gelyfa\u00f0 & georne witan \u00fe\u00e6t Crist Godes sunu to mannum com for ealles mancynnes \u00f0earfe. And we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hine cl\u00e6ne m\u00e6den geb\u00e6re, Sancta Maria, \u00fee n\u00e6fre nahte weres gemanan. And we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he mycel ge\u00f0olode & sti\u00f0lice \u00ferowode for ure ealra neode. And we gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hine man on rode ahenge & hine to dea\u00f0e acwealde & hine sy\u00f0\u00f0an on",
